    '[{"speaker":"A (ฝ่ายการเงิน)","thai":"งบประมาณไตรมาสนี้จัดสรรเรียบร้อยแล้ว","phonetic":"ngop-pra-maan trai-maat nee chat-san riap-roi laeo","english":"The budget for this quarter has been successfully allocated.","myanmar":"ယခု သုံးလပတ် ဘတ်ဂျက်ကို ခွဲဝေပြင်ဆင်ပြီးပါပြီ။","words":[{"thai":"งบประมาณ","phonetic":"ngop-pra-maan","english":"budget","myanmar":"ဘတ်ဂျက်","partOfSpeech":"noun"},{"thai":"ไตรมาส","phonetic":"trai-maat","english":"quarter (3 months)","myanmar":"သုံးလပတ်","partOfSpeech":"noun"},{"thai":"จัดสรร","phonetic":"chat-san","english":"allocate / distribute","myanmar":"ခွဲဝေပြင်ဆင်သည်","partOfSpeech":"verb"}]},{"speaker":"B (ผู้จัดการ)","thai":"เราต้องควบคุมกำไรและรายจ่ายให้สมดุล","phonetic":"rao tong khruab-khum kam-rai lae raai-chaai hai som-dun","english":"We must control profits and expenses to maintain balance.","myanmar":"အမြတ်နှင့် အသုံးစရိတ် မျှတစေရန် ထိန်းသိမ်းရပါမည်။","words":[{"thai":"กำไร","phonetic":"kam-rai","english":"profit","myanmar":"အမြတ်အစွန်း","partOfSpeech":"noun"},{"thai":"รายจ่าย","phonetic":"raai-chaai","english":"expense / expenditure","myanmar":"အသုံးစရိတ်","partOfSpeech":"noun"},{"thai":"สมดุล","phonetic":"som-dun","english":"balance / equilibrium","myanmar":"ညီမျှမှု","partOfSpeech":"noun"}]}]',
